    "description": {
      "content": "The OpenSearch Security plugin REST API lets administrators programmatically create and manage internal users, roles, role mappings, action groups, tenants, security configuration, audit log configuration, certificates, cache, allowlists, distinguished node names, and inspect the running security configuration. Endpoints are exposed under /_plugins/_security/api on the OpenSearch cluster.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: OpenSearch Project",
